# BloomCast — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. All services used by BloomCast have a free tier
# and NONE of them require a credit card. Every variable below is optional —
# the system falls back to committed seed data when they are unset.
#
# See scripts/verify-no-card.sh, which fails the build if any paid resource
# is referenced anywhere in the repo.

# ---- Backend (src/backend) -------------------------------------------------
# Where the precomputed forecast JSON lives. Committed to the repo by the
# nightly pipeline, so the free Render instance needs no database or disk.
# SEED_DIR=/app/src/data/seed
# WATERBODY_FILE=/app/src/data/waterbodies.geojson
# STREAM_FILE=/app/src/data/stream_segments.geojson
# REPLAY_FILE=/app/src/data/replay_events.json

# SQLite file for citizen observations + alert subscriptions.
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./bloomcast.db

# CORS origin for the deployed frontend.
# ALLOWED_ORIGIN=*

# ---- Optional AI explanations ("Generate report" buttons) -------------------
# Keys stay server-side. No key = honest "unavailable" message, nothing breaks.
# The LLM only narrates numbers the system computed — it never scores.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY=

# ---- Real-label training (optional) ----------------------------------------
# Point at Tick Tick Bloom competition CSVs to train on real in-situ labels
# instead of the synthetic stand-in. See docs/training-data.md.
# TICKTICKBLOOM_DIR=src/data/ticktickbloom

# ---- Nightly pipeline (GitHub Actions) -------------------------------------
# Copernicus Data Space OAuth2 — free registration, no card.
# COPERNICUS_USERNAME=
# COPERNICUS_PASSWORD=
# Open-Meteo is keyless (CC-BY 4.0); the base URL rarely needs overriding.
# OPEN_METEO_BASE=https://api.open-meteo.com
